sk1s.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%81%AB%E7%84%B0%E7%90%83.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/de/7znp88cof61ltp1vmgnivo8l5lask1s.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%81%AB%E7%84%B0%E7%90%83.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/de/7znp88cof61ltp1vmgnivo8l5lask1s.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />火焰球\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-4\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓5-↑3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>十字\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（魔法伤害）对目标范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格内所有敌人造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">170%</font>[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"火属性\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">火属性</font></span></span>]范围伤害，并施加<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"点燃\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">点燃</font></span></span>]。使地形格变为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"燃烧\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">燃烧</font></span></span>]、并对敌人施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"×受治疗\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">×受治疗</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼攻击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼攻击2</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-4 十字.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f9/o5kvypscpgms5z1gr2u7zau09k7ld4l.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-4_%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"82\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f9/o5kvypscpgms5z1gr2u7zau09k7ld4l.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-4_%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/f9/o5kvypscpgms5z1gr2u7zau09k7ld4l.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"148\" data-file-height=\"151\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%89%B9%E8%8E%89%E4%B8%9D\" title=\"角色图鉴库/特莉丝\"><img alt=\"头像 特莉丝.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/1f/gpqvn0pzn481yc3i2kcq3py4j6cxyqb.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">特莉丝</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"